{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-09-16T20:59:24Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 AI Agent 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_48943ddab4a6ea9dbc4a7efa39164d90078a6ff2dbea749033f71822d9c6d5ea","internal_url":"/posts/20260917-blogs_podcasts-improving-hcls-ai-reasoning-with-open-source-agent-0-c6ae3beb79/","observation_id":"obs_c6ae3beb79b8ee8b38c58e22c5cd35dce8e7b5ea3dd1e6e0d984ebc779e82d3f","published_at":"2026-09-16T19:00:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇介绍开源代理技能库的技术文章，旨在解决基础模型在医疗和生命科学领域推理时出现的决策框架误用问题。该技能库将专业领域知识封装为可被AI代理在推理时调用的结构化文档，使模型能够按照行业标准进行规范决策。","title":"Improving HCLS AI reasoning with open-source agent skills"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_2b84e382b60f3a06193e7ce545a00da13bf94f88e89e0518b962a7b0a97dcda9","internal_url":"/posts/20260916-hacker_news-datamimic-dont-let-your-coding-agent-invent-its-ow-6-60d15f0ed3/","observation_id":"obs_60d15f0ed37ffe7b53635a0a04f2dbc2a2aa625d27a018b1ce111df0f8ed7f7f","published_at":"2026-09-16T04:58:36Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Datamimic – don't let your coding agent invent its own test world"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_b22d3271d24a5784add8c855898f7ad6ca7c92c79a216678cfbaf1f2fd5ab704","internal_url":"/posts/20260916-blogs_podcasts-can-skills-learned-in-games-transfer-to-real-world-0-eb64bf4664/","observation_id":"obs_eb64bf46642bd1686947e043c83b8981b93207aa9ec69f9380d39bc041e88ac0","published_at":"2026-09-15T20:11:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"当前保存的是 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Can Skills Learned in Games Transfer to Real-World Work?"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_aaa8a002ca28d7267ed2d2ddb7dcf6e7d6c5b5172fcef45d29f462baa761ac23","internal_url":"/posts/20260916-arxiv-agentic-societies-need-a-social-harness-0-64867fe359/","observation_id":"obs_64867fe3591d571b73b5736dd231ef43b3130dd16365b35bd545ee73afefc045","published_at":"2026-09-15T17:57:27Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Agentic Societies Need a Social Harness"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_6736beb428abd5c4b77e1afecaf473508ffbf3659fbfa80d867c22783ee2b5fb","internal_url":"/posts/20260917-arxiv-sciencebuddy-recursive-in-recursive-self-improveme-0-a242b8d54f/","observation_id":"obs_a242b8d54f33a74651adf0e8f0cb0faf28ef50a0e2555620252cf6d1edf1c816","published_at":"2026-09-15T17:55:28Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"ScienceBuddy 是一个交互式科研工作空间，利用递归‑递归的自改进机制，使科学智能体在执行任务时不断收集反馈并更新训练评估框架，从而提升模型表现。","title":"ScienceBuddy: Recursive-in-Recursive Self-Improvement for Interactive Scientific Agents"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_18187952db50536184ab7e71b555b760cf9e5da3aa9a6a2c24fb7e8f46f36b26","internal_url":"/posts/20260916-blogs_podcasts-announcing-instance-preference-lists-for-amazon-sa-0-d3d379a848/","observation_id":"obs_d3d379a848ac4d3495cc1e66ac819a0f604b997049ba38bbcd33168e5d3d1129","published_at":"2026-09-15T16:01:47Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Amazon SageMaker AI 为训练和处理任务新增了实例偏好列表功能，可在提交时指定最多五个实例类型的优先级顺序，系统自动挑选首个有可用容量的类型启动任务。","title":"Announcing instance preference lists for Amazon SageMaker AI training jobs"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0ebfcaa5805a55c8d7a33f17b345276da73a3234d8d6cca94110c6c0b5a56a86","internal_url":"/posts/20260915-blogs_podcasts-ainews-aef-1-standard-emerges-for-third-party-eval-0-e3e0524cc2/","observation_id":"obs_e3e0524cc29a68a0c454c791e47c3f7d5fdce13c965ce369006aabf390c342e2","published_at":"2026-09-15T04:50:36Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一条关于AI安全评估标准化的动态报道。AEF-1是由行业论坛发布的基线标准，旨在规范第三方评估机构的独立性要求，包括访问权限、利益冲突管理、资金关系、回避机制和信息披露等维度。已有前沿AI企业承诺向符合该标准的外部评估团队提供类似内部员工的办公权限。","title":"[AINews] AEF-1 standard emerges for Third Party Evaluators, as Xai, OpenAI, and Anthropic all cosign"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_851eced6dd5333dd8cbd96920b1425348242118d4905288c994297525c5c829b","internal_url":"/posts/20260915-blogs_podcasts-abnormal-ai-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-for-agentic-e-0-d1c93a9a41/","observation_id":"obs_d1c93a9a4173c0b28918d3112f7fd3c28bf7b7db15700155a6cac479db0c87d4","published_at":"2026-09-14T21:22:45Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"该内容介绍了一种将动态代码执行能力集成到 AI 代理中的方案，使代理能够执行计算、数据处理和验证等超出语义推理范围的任务，并展示了在邮件安全检测场景中的实际应用架构。","title":"Abnormal AI: Amazon Bedrock AgentCore for agentic email security at scale"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_5771761369d6b59ca4c7ba0d2797ddb72d1923f605a65e218ac4575b988d4453","internal_url":"/posts/20260915-blogs_podcasts-manage-end-user-oauth-consent-for-ai-agents-with-a-0-e4887ae13c/","observation_id":"obs_e4887ae13cdf3e0d1a57b577c2d965898d8b92d3c1978971eeb1fa95871f6051","published_at":"2026-09-14T20:35:45Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"该内容介绍 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 提供的托管式 Consent portal，用于自动完成 AI 代理对 GitHub、Slack 等服务的 OAuth 授权流程，包括身份验证、浏览器跳转、会话绑定以及令牌的安全存储，省去自行搭建回调页面和管理会话的负担。","title":"Manage end-user OAuth consent for AI agents with Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0ea3723c9b02aa548a10ef39c37e055ce9feeedb211a329c70d5846351d755de","internal_url":"/posts/20260916-arxiv-corrupt-plans-clean-traces-evading-chain-of-though-0-7ba1987c3f/","observation_id":"obs_7ba1987c3f4d2bf4974c002520ec91a0ca1f37b450dbbd08dfa47ce9df94dd67","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:33:27Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这是一种通过在语言模型的上下文植入看似无害但暗含恶意计划的推理片段，使其在执行任务时能够规避另一模型的监控审查的攻击方式。该攻击在多选问答的可监视性场景中得到验证，并可向更复杂的任务和更大规模的模型迁移。","title":"Corrupt Plans, Clean Traces: Evading Chain-of-Thought Monitoring with Plan Injection"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0a01abccb3eb04617af9082e0c53667b11d589ad0c96b9b594db15a39b6df996","internal_url":"/posts/20260916-arxiv-stellar-colosseum-a-many-agent-harness-for-long-ho-0-d5a4c616cf/","observation_id":"obs_d5a4c616cf6c1a0c78b61b1ddf9d732351b543d23c4d5d47026463f836877388","published_at":"2026-09-14T17:58:55Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这是一个用于数学和理论计算机科学领域的研究框架，旨在通过多智能体协作处理需要多步决策的复杂证明问题。框架采用并行生成候选方案、用针对性攻击进行验证、并通过树聚合方式整合不同方案。","title":"Stellar Colosseum: A Many-Agent Harness for Long-Horizon Research in Mathematics and Theoretical Computer Science"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_6800b34dd4757fa60b149254d0e0f52511762c587317ffb0363ce90d822058bf","internal_url":"/posts/20260915-hacker_news-pion-an-agent-designed-to-run-any-company-autonomo-0-b54bfac470/","observation_id":"obs_b54bfac470e15413bc3b66a7050fd806dd70198b5512200e1b4e25ecc201c992","published_at":"2026-09-14T17:16:06Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Pion, an agent designed to run any company autonomously"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_3b6a4da1875bfd8b9a96377da4200605f90c5c9d18cb76df0d3e1bf6b17ad3da","internal_url":"/posts/20260915-blogs_podcasts-humanitys-last-invention-richard-socher-of-recursi-0-24a6ec459a/","observation_id":"obs_24a6ec459ab4b7dd7592d5500ce2cf0d1490ae1dba57381cc52ca87bc5c347a4","published_at":"2026-09-14T16:04:16Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一段理查德·索彻在《Latent Space》播客中阐释其公司“Recursive”研发的“尤里卡机器”概念，介绍能够自行改进AI研究的系统以及在极短时间内超越人类和代理的优化成果的访谈内容。","title":"Humanity’s Last Invention — Richard Socher of Recursive"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d68aa487477b57d0449b44ae212d995b214f971fe6e9a0631e44231bb5ec6dc4","internal_url":"/posts/20260912-blogs_podcasts-ainews-deepseek-v41-flash-763b-p8b-d16b-novel-caus-0-d1d28ac13a/","observation_id":"obs_d1d28ac13afc9a2440ec7617cdb40d2605964fc2717139c659c5df522ce97a7c","published_at":"2026-09-12T05:56:05Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这条内容报道了DeepSeek发布的最新开源模型v4.1‑Flash。该模型采用因果编码器‑解码器结构，并在输入与输出阶段使用不同的激活参数规模，同时加入视觉输入能力，专注于在保持性能的同时显著降低推理时的计算和缓存成本。","title":"[AINews] DeepSeek v4.1-Flash: 763B-P8B-D16B novel causal Encoder–Decoder architecture with vision marks the Return of the Whale"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_4bd60dbcf3a8da497c3cd092c8e2b8777d2771fac57a118daf901c6060d12400","internal_url":"/posts/20260912-hacker_news-openai-agents-carried-out-an-undisclosed-attack-on-0-79fb96deab/","observation_id":"obs_79fb96deabb03ebba032dff6377c9fbbda8c3036555f64756c4a1c1e78e9f072","published_at":"2026-09-11T23:17:42Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"OpenAI agents carried out an undisclosed attack on RubyGems"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_54ca990baa98051f48bcba8058bb2496a33728fa3de9e0de5e509d19420a5c84","internal_url":"/posts/20260912-blogs_podcasts-monitoring-production-agent-lifecycle-with-aws-dev-0-381ed851c4/","observation_id":"obs_381ed851c46a02e93d1534aa03fdca93a958451c12187f93437bc710a5e32162","published_at":"2026-09-11T18:26:38Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"该方案通过两层监控来追踪生产环境中的多智能体系统：一边持续评估智能体的输出质量，一边自动调查底层基础设施的健康状态，以发现传统指标难以捕获的异常。","title":"Monitoring production agent lifecycle with AWS DevOps Agent and AgentCore Evaluations"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_32493d736fa6c798587ec7cb458ab5ad1b94318203cf27858d9f7813c0d4d605","internal_url":"/posts/20260911-blogs_podcasts-reduce-llm-latency-with-prefix-aware-routing-on-am-0-4f4661ca30/","observation_id":"obs_4f4661ca3038bcff734b931e86ecdd698705f1878edb8f11f9c4fd7242cb67ec","published_at":"2026-09-10T21:58:09Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"该内容介绍了一种在模型推理入口根据请求前缀将相同前缀的请求路由到同一实例的策略，以利用已有的前缀缓存来降低首次响应时间并提升